    {
      "id": "claim_5c0335b381e2429ea7e404a122652144",
      "statement": "In the CECL model, scenario PD is base PD scaled by elasticity times the scenario's peak unemployment minus the Baseline anchor (Scenarios!B11 = C7) times 100, floored at 0; lifetime PD is 1-(1-PD)^remaining life; scenario LGD adjusts base LGD by the HPI change (mortgages) or CRE change (CRE) and is capped between 0 and 1; scenario ECL = EAD x lifetime PD x LGD.",
      "evidence": [
